# Setup GitHub profile

1. In `annarivalta/annarivalta`, replace `README.md`.
2. Upload `assets/hero.png`, `assets/hero.svg`, and `assets/process.svg` in the `assets` directory.
3. On GitHub personal account > Settings > Public profile > Profile picture, upload `assets/avatar-preview.png`. It is a rasterization of the original favicon, with no design changes.
4. Keep the existing GitHub Actions workflow and `output` branch to preserve the contribution snake.

## Typography

The SVG declares Instrument Sans and Instrument Serif with fallback fonts. Because their font files were not available in this environment, `hero.png` currently uses Lato and Liberation Serif fallback shapes. It is NOT a faithful embedded rendering of Instrument fonts. For accurate branding, open `hero.svg` with Instrument Sans and Instrument Serif installed, convert the headline text to paths, export PNG, and overwrite `assets/hero.png`. Do not upload font files if license terms do not allow redistribution.

## Design intent

Avatar = original mark, hero = positioning and promise, README = proof of thought and work. No repeated logo in hero, no badges or vanity stats.
